  "description": "After waking up inside a game, Minervina discovers that she has the ability to see information screens for everything within her new world. Unfortunately, she has also been given a quest to destroy this world, but she’s ignoring that. While Minervina wishes to use her near-omniscience to live a comfortable life, she’s continuously swept into chaos and political ploys. Her key to preserving the peace might be Exarch, the incorruptible Grand Duke. He seems to favor her, a trend that continues with everybody else, including the main system. Will Minervina be able to protect this world that loves her?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
